---
/**
 * UniHost — the persisted mount point for Uni (text chat + voice). Rendered ONCE in BaseLayout.
 * transition:persist keeps the node (and a live voice call's audio) across ClientRouter navigations.
 * The widget itself (/chat/spa-chat.js + .css) is loaded on the first [data-open="uni"] tap (site.ts). Phones and tablets:
 * never auto-opened. Desktop (owner request, 14 Nov 2026): site.ts loads it 3 s after the first page load and Uni slides in,
 * docked bottom right and not modal; it then stays on display across pages until the guest closes it.
 */
---
<div id="uni" transition:persist="uni" data-nosnippet></div>
